{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh2yYT2i31B3wzN9bVhi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HQjnNSvM7M1sFtDD8QF77k","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps = [\n# 1 tools/medals.mjs in the layout\n(\"\"\"    trackcheck.mjs        track validator (App. C algorithm), prints the §4.3 numbers\n\"\"\",\"\"\"    trackcheck.mjs        track validator (App. C algorithm), prints the §4.3 numbers\n    medals.mjs            measures the bot's best times per track/class and writes the medal targets (§4.2)\n\"\"\"),\n# 2 IIFE rule\n(\"\"\"- **No file may touch `E.THREE`, `E.TSL` or `E.World3D` at top level.**\"\"\",\"\"\"- **Every `src/` file is one IIFE**, `(() => { const E = My3D2dge, SN = globalThis.SN; … })();`. It registers what\n  it exports on `globalThis.SN`. Top-level `const`/`let` would collide once the files are concatenated into one\n  script, and in the vm context.\n- **No file may touch `E.THREE`, `E.TSL` or `E.World3D` at top level.**\"\"\"),\n# 3a OPTIONS includes DEV MODE; CONTINUE replaces SEASON label\n(\"\"\"OPTIONS opens SETTINGS / CONTROLS / HOW TO PLAY / RECORDS / ABOUT. CONTINUE appears at the top when an autosave exists (it goes to the season hub) |\"\"\",\n \"\"\"OPTIONS opens SETTINGS / CONTROLS / HOW TO PLAY / RECORDS / ABOUT / DEV MODE. When an autosave exists, the first tile reads **CONTINUE SEASON** (it loads `saves.latest()` and opens the season hub) |\"\"\"),\n# 4 pause items as a function\n(\"\"\"- `race` is the only `pausable: true` scene. It is not pausable in a hub session. Its pause menu (the engine's, from\n  `menu.items`) has:\"\"\",\"\"\"- `race` is the only `pausable: true` scene. It is not pausable in a hub session. Its pause menu is the engine's.\n  **`menu.items` may be a function**: the engine calls it each time the pause screen opens and drops falsy entries\n  (verified in the engine: `v(this._game.o.menu.items)` then `.filter(Boolean)`), so the items can depend on the\n  mode. It has:\"\"\"),\n# 5 Appendix B vowel bug\n(\"\"\"      const vowel = 'AEIOU'['AEIOUY'.indexOf(w[(i * 2 + 1) % w.length]) >= 0 ? 'AEIOU'.indexOf(w[(i * 2 + 1) % w.length]) : (rnd() * 5) | 0];\"\"\",\n \"\"\"      const ch = w[(i * 2 + 1) % w.length], vi = 'AEIOU'.indexOf(ch), vowel = 'AEIOU'[vi >= 0 ? vi : (rnd() * 5) | 0];\"\"\"),\n# 6 check.mjs path\n(\"\"\"`tools/check.mjs` on the bundle gives no errors (it will list the CDN files as external, which is expected)\"\"\",\n \"\"\"`node engine/handoff/tools/check.mjs ../<bundle>.html` gives no errors (it will list the CDN files as external, which is expected)\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    n=s.count(a)\n    assert n==1, (n, a[:80])\n    s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('ok', len(s.splitlines()), 'lines')\nEOF","description":"Apply review fixes to PLAN.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":440,"cache_read_input_tokens":479538,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":440},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0af7cd7c-7b61-489d-86ab-010715e3fe6f","uuid":"84786e97-deb0-4fe8-a4ed-93a1ea786958","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:39:47.597Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh2yYC9Ak26i4K5WDitq","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01HQjnNSvM7M1sFtDD8QF77k":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps = [\n# 1 tools/medals.mjs in the layout\n(\"\"\"    trackcheck.mjs        track validator (App. C algorithm), prints the §4.3 numbers\n\"\"\",\"\"\"    trackcheck.mjs        track validator (App. C algorithm), prints the §4.3 numb