{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh3C6yDLodwtouuubNEx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01P8yK339z7kK4PzF4pCycQC","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps=[\n(\"\"\"   - **Scrub:** speed `−= 0.6/s·|vl|·dt`. Sliding costs speed.\"\"\",\n \"\"\"   - **Scrub:** speed `−= scrubK·|vl|·dt` (scrubK 0.35/s). Sliding costs speed.\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"- Lateral grip caps out at `gripMax`. At SPARK top speed, full lock with no airbrake gives a path radius of\n  180–230 m, with the nose 15–35° inside the velocity. Holding the inside airbrake fully brings it to 110–150 m and\n  bleeds 6–12 m/s² of speed.\n- The 56 m Solenne lighthouse hairpin: about 185 km/h on the racing line without airbrakes, up to about 230 km/h\n  with the inside airbrake. It is taken without touching a wall by the AI at skill 1.\"\"\",\n \"\"\"- Lateral grip caps out at `gripMax`. These figures were checked with a 2D model of this exact step during planning\n  (KESTREL stats, SPARK, top 328 km/h):\n  - full lock with no airbrake, from top speed: path radius 120–150 m over the first second, the nose at the 35° slip\n    cap, about 255 km/h after 1.4 s, a slide that settles near 180 km/h if held;\n  - full lock with the inside airbrake fully on: radius 45–60 m, about 160 km/h after 1.4 s (the hairpin tool);\n  - steady cornering on a 65 m line: about 188 km/h without airbrakes, about 238 km/h with exactly the inside\n    airbrake the corner needs.\n\n  The Solenne lighthouse hairpin is taken without a wall touch by the AI at skill 1.\n- Side-shift moves the craft about 4 m sideways (768 u/s decaying at 12/s gives 4.2 m).\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"gripMaxMul 1 [0.4–2], slipMax 35° [10–60], sideShiftSpeed 768 [0–1500], shiftDecay 12 [4–30].\"\"\",\n \"\"\"gripMaxMul 1 [0.4–2], slipMax 35° [10–60], scrubK 0.35 [0–1], sideShiftSpeed 768 [0–1500], shiftDecay 12 [4–30].\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    n=s.count(a); assert n==1,(n,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Update scrub, feel targets and sliders with checked numbers"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2187,"cache_read_input_tokens":515022,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2187},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0af7cd7c-7b61-489d-86ab-010715e3fe6f","uuid":"f1691dad-c659-419f-8190-4f863c91c393","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:42:40.809Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh3C6iLFcu3Ngm8cvxbn","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01P8yK339z7kK4PzF4pCycQC":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps=[\n(\"\"\"   - **Scrub:** speed `−= 0.6/s·|vl|·dt`. Sliding costs speed.\"\"\",\n \"\"\"   - **Scrub:** speed `−= scrubK·|vl|·dt` (scrubK 0.35/s). Sliding costs speed.\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"- Lateral grip caps out at `gripMax`. At SPARK top speed, full lock with no airbrake gives a path radius of\n  180–230 m, with the nose 15–35° inside the velocity. Holding the inside airbrake fully brings it to 110–150 m and\n  bleeds 6–12 m/s² of speed.\n- The 56 m Solenne lighthouse hairpin: about 185 km/h on the racing line without airbrakes, up to about 230 km/h\n  with the inside airbrake. It is taken without touching a wall by the AI at skill 1.\"\"\",\n \"\"\"- Lateral grip caps out at `gripMax`. These figures were checked with a 2D model of this exact step during planning\n  (KESTREL stats, SPARK, top 328 km/h):\n  - full lock with no airbrake, from top speed: path radius 120–150 m over the first second, the nose at the 35° slip\n    cap, about 255 km/h after 1.4 s, a slide that settles near 180 km/h if held;\n  - full lock with the inside airbrake fully on: radius 45–60 m, about 160 km/h after 1.4 s (the hairpin tool);\n  - steady cornering on a 65 m line: about 188 km/h without airbrakes, about 238 km/h with exactly the inside\n    airbrake the corner needs.\n\n  The Solenne lighthouse hairpin is taken without a wall touch by the AI at skill 1.\n- Side-shift moves the craft about 4 m sideways (768 u/s decaying at 12/s gives 4.2 m).\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"gripMaxMul 1 [0.4–2], slipMax 35° [10–60], sideShiftSpeed 768 [0–1500], shiftDecay 12 [4–30].\"\"\",\n \"\"\"gripMaxMul 1 [0.4–2], slipMax 35° [10–60], scrubK 0.35 [0–1], sideShiftSpeed 768 [0–1500], shiftDecay 12 [4–30].\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    n=s.count(a); assert n==1,(n,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Update scrub, feel targets and sliders with checked numbers"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01P8yK339z7kK4PzF4pCycQC":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work"}}}
