{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh3Ebo7YVpDtkzHxFgJm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015FnodE2qKLXLVB8TjFTVRL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps=[\n(\"\"\"T.query(x, y, zHint)                             // 2D bucket lookup -> nearest slice with surface below zHint (particles, terrain, cameras)\"\"\",\n \"\"\"T.query(x, y, zHint)                             // 2D bucket lookup -> nearest slice with surface below zHint (particles, terrain, cameras)\nT.groundBelow(x, y, z)                           // the track surface z under (x, y) below z (via query), else -Infinity: World3D's particleGround\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  - `torch: false`, our own lights: 3 coloured spots plus team-coloured neon strips (our meshes);\"\"\",\n \"\"\"  - no torch tiles (`torchLights: 0`); our own lights: 3 coloured `world.light`s plus team-coloured neon strips\n    (our meshes);\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  - speed pad: an 8 × 6 m quad with 3 chevrons whose colours cycle front to back at 6 Hz (vertex colours rewritten\n    each frame or a UV scroll), cyan `#3ad8ff`;\"\"\",\n \"\"\"  - speed pad: an 8 × 6 m quad with 3 chevrons whose colours cycle front to back at 6 Hz (the pad meshes' colour\n    attribute rewritten each frame, `needsUpdate`), cyan `#3ad8ff`;\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"- **Overclock skin:** a second material set per chunk. Black surface with an emissive grid (lines every 4 m, colour\n  `hsl(zone·37°, 100%, 60%)`), neon wall lines, scenery hidden, terrain hidden by fog (`fog` near 150 m, far 600 m,\n  black), sky black with slow colour pulses, bloom up.\"\"\",\n \"\"\"- **Overclock skin:** a **separate world** that the `loading` scene builds for OVERCLOCK runs (and the attract's\n  overclock segment), so no fog or sky changes are needed at runtime:\n  - theme `overclock`: black sky, black fog close in (near 2400 u, far 9600 u), flat black terrain at −400 m, no\n    scenery;\n  - the same track chunks built with the overclock materials: a black surface with an emissive grid (lines every 4 m)\n    and neon wall lines;\n  - each zone changes only the materials' colour, `hsl(zone·37°, 100%, 60%)` (no new materials, so no shader builds);\n  - sky colour pulses on the beat; bloom up.\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    n=s.count(a); assert n==1,(n,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Fix groundBelow API, hangar lights, pad animation and overclock world"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6569,"cache_read_input_tokens":525158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6569},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0af7cd7c-7b61-489d-86ab-010715e3fe6f","uuid":"8e4d0b07-3205-4bf8-b2a9-9278ad292bcf","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:43:17.282Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh3EbWzYZdGn7FcGVKS7","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015FnodE2qKLXLVB8TjFTVRL":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nreps=[\n(\"\"\"T.query(x, y, zHint)                             // 2D bucket lookup -> nearest slice with surface below zHint (particles, terrain, cameras)\"\"\",\n \"\"\"T.query(x, y, zHint)                             // 2D bucket lookup -> nearest slice with surface below zHint (particles, terrain, cameras)\nT.groundBelow(x, y, z)                           // the track surface z under (x, y) below z (via query), else -Infinity: World3D's particleGround\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  - `torch: false`, our own lights: 3 coloured spots plus team-coloured neon strips (our meshes);\"\"\",\n \"\"\"  - no torch tiles (`torchLights: 0`); our own lights: 3 coloured `world.light`s plus team-coloured neon strips\n    (our meshes);\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"  - speed pad: an 8 × 6 m quad with 3 chevrons whose colours cycle front to back at 6 Hz (vertex colours rewritten\n    each frame or a UV scroll), cyan `#3ad8ff`;\"\"\",\n \"\"\"  - speed pad: an 8 × 6 m quad with 3 chevrons whose colours cycle front to back at 6 Hz (the pad meshes' colour\n    attribute rewritten each frame, `needsUpdate`), cyan `#3ad8ff`;\"\"\"),\n(\"\"\"- **Overclock skin:** a second material set per chunk. Black surface with an emissive grid (lines every 4 m, colour\n  `hsl(zone·37°, 100%, 60%)`), neon wall lines, scenery hidden, terrain hidden by fog (`fog` near 150 m, far 600 m,\n  black), sky black with slow colour pulses, bloom up.\"\"\",\n \"\"\"- **Overclock skin:** a **separate world** that the `loading` scene builds for OVERCLOCK runs (and the attract's\n  overclock segment), so no fog or sky changes are needed at runtime:\n  - theme `overclock`: black sky, black fog close in (near 2400 u, far 9600 u), flat black terrain at −400 m, no\n    scenery;\n  - the same track chunks built with the overclock materials: a black surface with an emissive grid (lines every 4 m)\n    and neon wall lines;\n  - each zone changes only the materials' colour, `hsl(zone·37°, 100%, 60%)` (no new materials, so no shader builds);\n  - sky colour pulses on the beat; bloom up.\"\"\"),\n]\nfor a,b in reps:\n    n=s.count(a); assert n==1,(n,a[:80]); s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Fix groundBelow API, hangar lights, pad animation and overclock world"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_015FnodE2qKLXLVB8TjFTVRL":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work"}}}
