{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh3HmhFVhDbvYzjHd6yg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012XJnbabqWarDzuJfb8HasX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"  - **P1:** W/S pitch, A/D steer, F thrust, G fire, H absorb, R/T airbrakes, Y camera, V/B side-shift;\n  - **P2:** ↑/↓ pitch, ←/→ steer, `.` thrust, `/` fire, `,` absorb, L/`;` airbrakes, `'` camera, K/N side-shift.\n\n  Show both layouts on the join screen with keycap glyphs.\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"  - **P1:** W/S pitch, A/D steer, F thrust, G fire, H absorb, R/T airbrakes, Y camera, V/B side-shift;\n  - **P2:** ↑/↓ pitch, ←/→ steer, `.` (Numpad 1) thrust, `/` (Numpad 2) fire, `,` (Numpad 3) absorb, L / `;`\n    (Numpad 4/5) airbrakes, `'` (Numpad 6) camera, K / M (Numpad 7/8) side-shift.\n\n  Both airbrakes together brake (`brake` and `lookBack` get no key in a half). Show both layouts on the join screen\n  with keycap glyphs, read from `players[i].label()`, never typed in by hand.\"\"\"\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Correct the player-2 half-keyboard layout"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":809,"cache_read_input_tokens":547400,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":809},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0af7cd7c-7b61-489d-86ab-010715e3fe6f","uuid":"b5d5951d-c37d-48ae-b9f8-04004e3de724","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:43:46.791Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh3HmS827knDeXCJ3kMj","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_012XJnbabqWarDzuJfb8HasX":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='PLAN.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"  - **P1:** W/S pitch, A/D steer, F thrust, G fire, H absorb, R/T airbrakes, Y camera, V/B side-shift;\n  - **P2:** ↑/↓ pitch, ←/→ steer, `.` thrust, `/` fire, `,` absorb, L/`;` airbrakes, `'` camera, K/N side-shift.\n\n  Show both layouts on the join screen with keycap glyphs.\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"  - **P1:** W/S pitch, A/D steer, F thrust, G fire, H absorb, R/T airbrakes, Y camera, V/B side-shift;\n  - **P2:** ↑/↓ pitch, ←/→ steer, `.` (Numpad 1) thrust, `/` (Numpad 2) fire, `,` (Numpad 3) absorb, L / `;`\n    (Numpad 4/5) airbrakes, `'` (Numpad 6) camera, K / M (Numpad 7/8) side-shift.\n\n  Both airbrakes together brake (`brake` and `lookBack` get no key in a half). Show both layouts on the join screen\n  with keycap glyphs, read from `players[i].label()`, never typed in by hand.\"\"\"\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF","description":"Correct the player-2 half-keyboard layout"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_012XJnbabqWarDzuJfb8HasX":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174728__x978410/work"}}}
